%N A399352 Number of independent vertex sets in the n X 2 projective plane graph.
%C A399352 Also the number of independent vertex sets in the n X 2 Moebius strip graph. This should not be confused with the Moebius ladder graph which is the 2 X n Moebius strip.
%H A399352 Andrew Howroyd, <a href="/A399352/b399352.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..1000</a>
%H A399352 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/IndependentVertexSet.html">Independent Vertex Set</a>.
%H A399352 <a href="/index/Rec#order_06">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (0,5,0,1,0,-1).
%F A399352 a(n) = 5*a(n-2) + a(n-4) - a(n-6).
%F A399352 G.f.: (1 + x)*(1 + 2*x - 2*x^2 + 2*x^3 - x^4)/(1 - 5*x^2 - x^4 + x^6).
%t A399352 LinearRecurrence[{0, 5, 0, 1, 0, -1}, {1, 3, 5, 15, 27, 77}, 35] (* _Paolo Xausa_, Aug 28 2026 *)
%o A399352 (PARI) Vec((1 + x)*(1 + 2*x - 2*x^2 + 2*x^3 - x^4)/(1 - 5*x^2 - x^4 + x^6) + O(x^31))
%Y A399352 Column k=2 of A399352 and A399103.
